              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, at’ Ikirimba c’inyubakwa kirābana n’i burasirazuba kize came kijishwe mu misi y’ ibikorwa ukw ar’ itandatu; ariko ku musi w’isabato kijishurwe, bo no ku musi ukwezi kubonetseko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
