          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu misi mikuru no mu yindi misi mikuru ishinzwe, ishikanwa ry’ifu rize ribe efa imwe igeretswe ku masa yose, na efa imwe nyene igeretswe ku mpfizi y’intama yose, n’irigerekwa ku myagazi y’intama az’ atange ibimushobokeye, no kuri efa yose y’ifu hajekw amavuta, ingero yitwa hini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
