                "loc": "DEU.23.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Gus 23:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi segaba, igihe azotanga ikimazi avyigombeye, ar’ ikimazi co kwoswa cank’ ar’ ibimazi vy’ishimwe, abitanze k’Uhoraho avyigombeye, haze hagire ūmujishurira ikirimba kirābana n’i burasirazuba, atange ikimazi ciwe co kwoswa n’ibimazi vyiwe vy’ishimwe, nk’ukw asanzwe abikora ku musi w’isabato, aheze agende; amaze kugenda hagire ūjisha ico kirimba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
