              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 29:38-40",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nawe uz’ utange uko bukeye umwagazi w’intama umaze umwaka umwe, kand’ utagira agasembga, kuba ikimazi co kwosereza Uhoraho: uze wame uwutanga mu gatondo mu gatondo uko bukeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ uze wame uwugerekakw ishikanwa ry’ifu mu gatondo uko bukeye nyene, ribe ikigira gatandatu ca efa y’ifu igogōretse, n’ikigira gatatu ca hini y’ amavuta, yo kuvanga n’iyo fu; ribe ishikanwa ry’ifu k’Uhoraho ry’intahava, icagezwe c’ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukw abe ari ko bazotanga umwagazi w’intama, bo n’ishikanwa ry’ifu n’amavuta, mu gatondo mu gatondo uko bukeye, kuba ikimazi co kwoswa c’intahava.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.46.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
