              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uku ni k’Umwami Uhoraho agize, ati Segaba ni yagira aho akebera umwe mu bana biwe, hazoba ishamvu yiwe, hazotoranwa n’abana biwe; hazoba inyegu yabo kukw ar’ ishamvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.46.16",
